   </div></details></nav></div></header><script>(function(){var d=document.querySelector(".mnav");if(!d)return;document.addEventListener("click",function(e){if(d.open&&!d.contains(e.target))d.open=false});document.addEventListener("keydown",function(e){if(e.key==="Escape"&&d.open){d.open=false;d.querySelector("summary").focus()}})})();</script><main><nav class="crumb w" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> › <span>NCLEX remediation for nursing programs</span></nav><section class="hero w hv"><div><h1>NCLEX remediation for nursing programs, built from the scores you already have</h1><p class="lead">Import your cohort's outside assessment results, see who needs help in which topic, assign targeted practice in one click and keep a remediation record. Students and instructors are free.</p><div class="cta"><a class="btn" href="/for-nursing-schools#pilot">Request a free semester pilot</a><a class="btn alt" href="#pricing">See pricing</a></div></div><figure class="shot"><div class="dv dv-b"><div class="dv-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>nclexsim.com</span></div><div class="dv-v"><img src="/img/os-cohort-1600.webp" srcset="/img/os-cohort-1000.webp 1000w, /img/os-cohort-1600.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) calc(100vw - 32px), 720px" width="1600" height="1000" alt="Instructor view of outside scores for a fictional cohort: 5 of 8 students below Level 2 in Pharmacology, with an Assign drill to these students button beside each weak topic" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></div></div><figcaption>The Outside scores tab in the instructor workspace, with a fictional cohort.</figcaption></figure></section><div class="w"><style>
.os-steps{counter-reset:os;list-style:none;padding:0;margin:16px 0;display:grid;gap:10px}.os-steps li{counter-increment:os;position:relative;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px 12px 58px;display:grid;gap:2px}
.os-steps li::before{content:counter(os);position:absolute;left:14px;top:12px;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink);font:700 16px/30px var(--fb);text-align:center}.os-steps b{font-size:17.5px}
.os-keep{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:16px;margin:14px 0}.os-keep>div{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:4px 18px 10px}.os-keep>div:first-child{border-top:4px solid var(--good)}.os-keep>div:last-child{border-top:4px solid var(--accent)}.os-keep li{margin:6px 0}
.os-lv{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,220px),1fr));gap:12px;margin:14px 0}.os-lv>div{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:4px solid var(--accent);padding:12px 14px}.os-lv b{display:block;font:400 20px var(--fh);margin-bottom:2px}.os-lv q{font-style:italic}
.os-along{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-left:5px solid var(--gold);padding:14px 18px;margin:16px 0}.os-along p{margin:0}
.os-src{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);padding-left:22px}.os-src li{margin:6px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.os-cite{font-size:.72em;line-height:0}.os-cite a{text-decoration:none}
.os-disc{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px;margin-top:28px}
.os-plan>div{border-radius:8px}.os-tl{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted)}</style>
    <h2>Remediation that's assigned, done and on the record</h2>
    <p>Your students already take ATI, HESI, Kaplan or UWorld assessments. Vexcura turns the topics those reports flag into practice students finish, shows faculty who needs help in which topic, and keeps a record of what was assigned and completed.</p>
    <div class="feat"><div><b>Cohort import</b>Bring in a whole cohort from the vendor's CSV or Excel export. Read in the browser; only matched scores are sent.</div><div><b>Weak-topic dashboard</b>Summaries like "5 of 8 students below Level 2 in Pharmacology", with the students named one tap away.</div><div><b>Assign remediation</b>One click assigns a targeted drill, with a due date, to exactly the students who need it.</div><div><b>Remediation record</b>A CSV or printable record of results, topics, assignments, completion and practice accuracy.</div></div>
    <div class="split rev"><div class="st"><h2>Import a cohort in minutes</h2><ol><li>Open the instructor workspace and choose <b>Outside scores</b>, then <b>Import results</b>.</li><li>Pick the test maker, the assessment name and the date.</li><li>Choose the CSV or Excel export. Vexcura reads it in your browser and shows a preview: how many rows matched your students, and why any didn't.</li><li>Save. Each student sees the result about them, read-only, and the weak-topic summary updates.</li></ol></div><figure class="shot"><div class="dv dv-b"><div class="dv-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>nclexsim.com</span></div><div class="dv-v"><img src="/img/os-cohort-1600.webp" srcset="/img/os-cohort-1000.webp 1000w, /img/os-cohort-1600.webp 1600w" sizes="(max-width: 760px) calc(100vw - 32px), 720px" width="1600" height="1000" alt="Instructor view of outside scores for a fictional cohort: 5 of 8 students below Level 2 in Pharmacology, with an Assign drill to these students button beside each weak topic" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div></div><figcaption>Who needs help, for a fictional cohort of eight students.</figcaption></figure></div>
    <h2>The weak-topic dashboard</h2>
    <p>For each assessment area and each Vexcura study topic, the dashboard counts the students whose latest result is below Level 2, or under 65% when the test has no levels, and the students with that topic to review. The largest groups come first. Expand any line to see the names.</p>
    <h2>Assign remediation in one click</h2>
    <p>Choose <b>Assign drill to these students</b>, set a due date and send. A 10-question drill on that topic, with rationales and sources, goes on each student's worklist the next time they open Vexcura, and it appears in your list of work you've sent. Students also get their own study plan when they bring in a report themselves.</p>
    <h2>A remediation record for board and accreditation evidence</h2>
    <p>Download the remediation record as a CSV, or print it. For each student and outside result it lists the test maker and assessment, the date, the score and proficiency level or predicted probability, the topics to review and the Vexcura study areas they map to, the remediation items assigned and completed with dates and who assigned them, and the student's Vexcura practice accuracy in that area.</p>
    <p class="soon"><b>Coming soon:</b> board-ready reporting, included in every plan.</p>
    <h2>FERPA-minded handling</h2>
    <ul><li><b>Least data needed.</b> Vexcura keeps the test name, date, overall result and topic names with scores. It never stores vendor questions, vendor logins or patient identifiers, and refuses entries that look like them.</li>
     <li><b>Files stay local.</b> Score report PDFs and cohort files are read in the browser. A student's file is kept only if the student chooses "Keep a copy".</li>
     <li><b>Clear ownership.</b> Imported results belong to your program and are visible to its instructors, program admins and the student they describe. Results a student adds are shared with instructors only when the student allows it.</li>
     <li><b>Anonymous totals only.</b> The daily question writer uses counts of commonly weak topics across students, and any topic with fewer than 5 students is left out.</li>
     <li><b>Paperwork for your review.</b> The contract packet includes a student data privacy agreement and a written statement of what's collected and who can see it. <a href="/for-nursing-schools#pilot">Request it</a>.</li></ul>
    <h2>Works alongside your assessment vendor</h2><div class="os-along"><p><b>Keep using ATI, HESI, Kaplan or UWorld.</b> Vexcura doesn't give, score or replace proctored exams, and it doesn't reproduce or reinterpret any test maker's questions, reports or remediation materials. It takes the topics your own report lists and turns them into practice in Vexcura. Finish whatever remediation your program requires first; Vexcura adds practice on top of it.</p></div>
    <p>Students can read how it works for them: <a href="/ati-score-report-study-plan">ATI</a>, <a href="/hesi-score-report-study-plan">HESI</a>, <a href="/kaplan-score-report-study-plan">Kaplan</a> and <a href="/uworld-score-report-study-plan">UWorld</a>.</p>
    <style>
